        "guide_size建議在512~1024範圍之間，數字越大速度越慢。如果面部修復功能沒有生效時，需提高guide_size的數字。 或是重新啟動comfyui。\n\nsteps:4~8，步數越多越面部修復越仔細，但速度會更慢。\n\n調整\"denoise\"可以控制面部重繪的幅度。\n\n\nThe guide size is recommended to be between 512 and 1024; the larger the number, the slower the speed. \n\nIf the facial repair function is ineffective, the guide_size number needs to be increased.  Or restart comfyui.\n\nSteps: 4~8. The more steps, the more detailed the facial retouching, but the slower the process.\n\nAdjusting \"denoise\" controls the extent of facial redrawing.\n"
